OL,3,GNEWSAMore than 800,000 hours of sewage
OL,4,Aspills in Wales last year, report
OL,5,Aclaims
OL,6,
OL,7,FNew figures show sewage was released
OL,8,Finto rivers, lakes and the sea around
OL,9,FWales for more than 800,000 hours last
OL,10,Fyear.
OL,12,FThe charity Surfers Against Sewage,
OL,13,Fwhich has analysed data from Wales'
OL,14,Fwater companies, said there were more
OL,15,Fthan 100,000 sewage discharges in 2025
OL,16,F- or one every five minutes.
OL,18,FThe figures are down on the year before
OL,19,Fwhen sewage was discharged for more
OL,20,Fthan 970,000 hours.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
