OL,3,GNEWSAMore than 800,000 hours of sewage
OL,4,Aspills in Wales last year, report
OL,5,Aclaims
OL,6,
OL,7,FNatural Resources Wales (NRW) said it
OL,8,Fhad strengthened its approach as
OL,9,Fregulators through increased monitoring
OL,10,Fand tighter guidance, and had overseen
OL,11,F"significant programmes of
OL,12,Fenvironmental investment" by water
OL,13,Fcompanies.
